  <!-- Lengths use meridians so 1° latitude ≈ 111.195 km at R=6371000 m.
       5 km → Δlat 0.0449660803; 8 km → 0.0719457285; 30 km → 0.2697964818. -->

  <!-- Ridge Walk (~10 km, named, in-band). Difficulty = max(hiking, mountain_hiking).
